DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261124T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261124T213000
SUMMARY:Built with Lovable · Lausanne #2
LOCATION:Lausanne (address on registration)
DESCRIPTION:A 90-minute hands-on build where everyone ships a working web a
 pp with AI features using Lovable’s built-in models — no API keys or s
 eparate accounts — with mentors on hand\, then demos and drinks. Bring a
  laptop and an idea.\n\nOrganiser: Lovable Lausanne (Maxime Dumont)\n\nDet
 ails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/built-with-lovabl
 e-lausanne-2-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/built-with-lovable-lausanne-2-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:epfl-reshaping-information-research-with-ai-2026@swissdataevents.ch
DTSTAMP:20261121T132509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261201T143000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261201T163000
SUMMARY:Reshaping Information Research with AI
LOCATION:EPFL\, room MED 0 1618\, Lausanne
DESCRIPTION:Two-hour on-site workshop from the EPFL Library comparing four 
 AI-powered research assistants\, how they work and where they differ from 
 traditional information retrieval. Open to the public\, registration requi
 red.\n\nOrganiser: EPFL Library\n\nDetails and registration: https://swiss
 dataevents.ch/events/epfl-reshaping-information-research-with-ai-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/epfl-reshaping-information-research-w
 ith-ai-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
