SUMMARY:Lausanne Hackathon — Swiss {ai} Weeks
LOCATION:unlimitrust campus\, Route des Flumeaux 42\, Prilly (Lausanne)
DESCRIPTION:An in-person hackathon where mixed teams of students\, develope
 rs\, startups\, public-sector innovators and corporate experts build pract
 ical AI solutions to challenges set by partner organisations\, open to all
  skill levels.\n\nOrganiser: Swiss {ai} Weeks\n\nDetails and registration:
  https://swissdataevents.ch/events/swiss-ai-weeks-lausanne-hackathon-2026/
